Based on ideas in the recent "Taming the RNG" thread started by Adam Trace
Spragg, here's a quick and rather dirty, only marginally tested, first
version of a "tournament mode" patch for Nethack 3.4.1:

        http://waah.dyndns.org/nhtournament/

In tournament mode, the dungeon is pregenerated at the beginning of the
game from a random number seed. A particular seed always yields the same
dungeon as well as the same starting attributes and equipment for each
character class.

This is currently platform-dependent, so each seed will probably yield a
different dungeon on different platforms.  If there's any interest, I'll
look into platform independence; it seems like it should be feasible.
